  m_text: "\tYour goal is to have a higher score than your opponent at the end of
    the game. A game consists of 3-7 waves shown as blocks above your screen.\n\r\tA
    wave passes when your screen fills up, at which point your score gets calculated.
    If you fill your entire screen with blocks, you will overflow and get no score
    at the end of  the wave."
